<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.11 vs     1.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.04 vs     2.49</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.22 vs     1.76</p>
<p> Sales		  161.47 vs   138.53</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    24.21 vs    42.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	40.91 vs    61.48</p>
<p> Operating profit    36.52 vs    29.92</p>
<p> Sales		1,340.15 vs 1,560.70</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel trader is Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
